t;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:35:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/researchers-discovered-a-surprisingly-simple-way-to-boost-your-creativity-but-does-it-work/</guid></item><item><title>三位被低估的 2000 年代 R&amp;amp;B 艺术家来证明您的品味</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-underrated-2000s-rb-artists-to-prove-you-have-good-taste/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Noisey 选择了三位被低估的 2000 年代 R&amp;amp;B 艺术家，他们在今天的复古播放列表中值得更多的喜爱。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-underrated-2000s-rb-artists-to-prove-you-have-good-taste/"&gt;3 位被低估的 2000 年代 R&amp;amp;B 艺术家证明你有良好品味的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:15:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/3-underrated-2000s-rb-artists-to-prove-you-have-good-taste/</guid></item><item><title>Schoolboy Q 明确回应了有关已故说唱歌手的问题：“我希望人们不要再问我已故朋友的事”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/schoolboy-q-shuts-down-questions-about-late-rapper-with-explicit-response-i-wish-people-would-stop-asking-me-about-my-dead-friend/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Schoolboy Q 不喜欢被问及他已故的朋友麦克·米勒 (Mac Miller)，他公开告诉粉丝这不是一个“有趣的时光”。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/schoolboy-q-shuts-down-questions-about-late-rapper-with-explicit-response-i-wish-people-would-stop-asking-me-about-my-dead-friend/"&gt;男生 Q 明确回应了关于已故说唱歌手的问题：“我希望人们不要再问我死去的朋友了”&lt;/a&gt;一文首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:54:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/schoolboy-q-shuts-down-questions-about-late-rapper-with-explicit-response-i-wish-people-would-stop-asking-me-about-my-dead-friend/</guid></item><item><title>科学家刚刚发现尼安德特人喜欢吃海狸</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/scientists-just-discovered-that-neanderthals-loved-eating-beaver/</link><description